# SEO And Metadata

Per-route title, description, and Open Graph. Host, robots, sitemap, JSON-LD, and GEO laws: `@seo-geo-standard.mdc` and `docs/guides/marketing-seo-geo.md`.

## Per route

- Export `metadata` (or `generateMetadata` when dynamic) with unique `title` and `description`.
- Blog and shareable landings: include `openGraph` (title, description, images when available).
- One clear `h1` per page view (via `PageHero` or section hero).
- Prefer `buildLocaleMetadata` so canonical + hreflang stay consistent.

## Site map

- Base URL: `getSiteUrl()` in `src/lib/site-url.ts` (`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` override) — used by `src/app/sitemap.ts`. Production default is `https://www.onetap-card.com`.
- Add static routes when introducing new top-level pages.
- Blog slugs: use `getAllSlugs()` / `getBlogPosts()` — do not hardcode slug lists in sitemap.

## Checklist

See `docs/engineering/seo-checklist.md` and `docs/guides/marketing-seo-geo.md`.

## Avoid

- Duplicate default titles across routes.
- Orphan routes (live URL not in sitemap without intentional `noindex`).
- Hardcoding apex `https://onetap-card.com` in metadata or OG URLs.
